<!-- =======================================================
     04 / FINAL DESIGN
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="04"
  label="Final Design"
  title="One system designed to accommodate very different kinds of information."
>
  <p>
    The redesign extended across the complete faculty
    website rather than a single landing page.
  </p>

  <p>
    Shared typography, spacing, navigation,
    components, colors, and interaction patterns
    create continuity, while each page is allowed to
    respond to its own content and audience.
  </p>

  <p>
    The following pages illustrate how that system
    scales across three very different experiences.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


